values (md5('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001:dj:noam-kochav')::uuid, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Noam Kochav', 'noam-kochav', '“There is nothing quite like a moment when a nostalgic hit plays with a rhythm, one you cant remain indifferent to”

From early childhood he fell in love with music.

.Started as the child prodigy who freely plays the guitar and piano

And when you know he’s the one on the music, get ready to pull out of the drawer in your head the strongest hits you’ve already forgotten and hear them like you’ve never heard them before and as part of an experience you’ve never experienced.

He does not believe that there are people on the planet who only like one style of music, and bet that it takes one event of his only – to make every person connect to a various types of music that he has never connected to before, and all thanks to an electrifying atmosphere, good people and music that you simply can’t help but dance to.', array['Nostalgic hits','Multi-genre','Musician']::text[], '/djs/noam-kochav.webp', '/djs/noam-kochav-logo.svg', '{"instagram":"https://instagram.com/kochav_?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1BKGoo9ZYXq9C4bjXIkrdd?si=WAC3Ubf2Rnqtv8pKBl0EfA"}'::jsonb, 'dj', true, 2, false)
