values (md5('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001:dj:shai-argaman')::uuid, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Shai Argaman', 'shai-argaman', '“The music will stop only until the last of the guests falls of his feet”

The classic story of the little kid who became acquainted with music by accident and fell in love.

From concerts in the living room for his family and performances for free at little local clubs, to long night performances in front of thousands of mesmerized people that keep dancing without looking at the time.

By giving special attention to the event owner’s requests combined with his unique perception of music, he makes each event unique and unlike any other event you have ever experienced.', array['Late-night energy','Personal requests']::text[], '/djs/shai-argaman.webp', '/djs/shai-argaman-logo.svg', '{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/djshai_argaman?utm_source=ig_web_button_share_sheet&igsh=ZDNlZDc0MzIxNw%3D%3D","spotify":"https://tr.ee/C7UHnrFkn7"}'::jsonb, 'dj', true, 3, false)
