values (md5('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001:dj:lior-zeevi')::uuid, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Lior Zeevi', 'lior-zeevi', '“Mainstream is all I want”

He started his journey at private events, slowly gaining momentum and producing music in his own unique style, until he established his place in Israel’s best weddings and clubs. Today, he stands as one of the most prominent DJs in Israel, filled with performances, productions, and festival appearances. He is known for his talent in organizing events with a professional touch and skillfully adjusting the music to suit the audience’s preferences.One of the things that excites him the most is playing at weddings, where he brings his electrifying energy and passion to create unforgettable moments.', array['Mainstream','Producer','Festivals']::text[], '/djs/lior-zeevi.webp', '/djs/lior-zeevi-logo.svg', '{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/dj_liorzeevi/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/liorzeevi"}'::jsonb, 'dj', true, 4, false)
on conflict (company_id, slug) do update set display_name = excluded.display_name, bio_en = excluded.bio_en, photo_url = excluded.photo_url, logo_url = excluded.logo_url, links = excluded.links, kind = excluded.kind;
values (md5('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001:dj:ta-yo')::uuid, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Ta-Yo', 'ta-yo', 'The most important thing I believe in is being able to read the dance floor and give it” “exactly what it needs, to feel the crowd and keep the energy alive.

TA-YO has been a DJ for 9 years, and his love for music is something that cannot be described in words – it’s simply in his soul. He knows how to blend all music styles seamlessly and create an experience that’s unforgettable, ensuring the dance floor is always energized. TA-YO has performed in top clubs across Israel and Tel Aviv, as well as internationally, including a set in Mykonos before Against of Time. He also warmed up for Vini Vici at a massive event, which was one of the highlights of his career. TA-YO is a resident DJ in the Israeli hard techno scene with the production Radio Berlin, and he is not only a DJ but also a music producer who understands exactly what the dance floor needs to keep the party going. Every performance he delivers is a unique experience, where the crowd just can’t stop dancing.', array['Hard techno','Producer','Multi-genre']::text[], '/djs/ta-yo.webp', '/djs/ta-yo-logo.svg', '{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/dj_tayo_?utm_source=ig_web_button_share_sheet&igsh=ZDNlZDc0MzIxNw%3D%3D"}'::jsonb, 'dj', true, 5, false)
