values (md5('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001:dj:liav-yehuda')::uuid, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Liav Yehuda', 'liav-yehuda', 'As a DJ who thrives on the energy of the crowd, Liav specializes in mainstream music that gets everyone on their feet. Starting his journey at a young age, he has gained momentum and built a dedicated audience over the years. There’s nothing more exhilarating for Liav than seeing hands up and bodies moving to the beat, creating an electrifying atmosphere that makes every event unforgettable. Liav’s passion for music is driven by the emotional connection seen in the audience, and he strives to craft experiences where every song resonates deeply. Whether it’s a wedding, a club night, or a festival, Liav brings his unique style and infectious energy to ensure the dance floor is always alive and the memories last a lifetime.', array['Mainstream','Weddings','Clubs']::text[], '/djs/liav-yehuda.webp', '/djs/liav-yehuda-logo.svg', '{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/liav.yehuda/","youtube":"https://youtube.com/@liav.yehuda?si=J8VEkiIbr2hfSTOm","soundcloud":"https://on.soundcloud.com/vDVdzWhguxH5nL2U9"}'::jsonb, 'dj', true, 7, false)
on conflict (company_id, slug) do update set display_name = excluded.display_name, bio_en = excluded.bio_en, photo_url = excluded.photo_url, logo_url = excluded.logo_url, links = excluded.links, kind = excluded.kind;
values (md5('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001:dj:itay-itshaki')::uuid, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Itay Itshaki', 'itay-itshaki', 'Known as one of Israel’s finest DJs, Itay Itshaki has years of experience playing for diverse crowds in different genres. Armed with a broad musical knowledge and a deep love for the dancefloor, Itay has developed a long-standing career full of highs.

Highly in demand within the Israeli local scene, Itay is known for being a resident DJ of the biggest student festival Funjoya for ten years in a row and can be found at almost every major event in Israel, playing out in front of the biggest crowds the Israeli scene can offer with a setlist full of dynamic dance favourites.

Reading the audience is a sixth sense, and it is something that he can do meticulously alongside his perfect timing of finding just the right track to suit any vibe. Whether it’s a wedding, a festival or a corporate event – these skills are not exclusive to one area, having just as much experience in the wedding world aswell as the clubbing scene.

Itay’s ability to create the perfect atmosphere is what placed him at the forefront of the Israeli DJ scene. Bringing his wide knowledge of the music scene, genres and meticulous crowd reading skills to any wedding, club, private event or a festival.

Aside from this, Itay can be found warming up for dance music industry titans such as Hardwell, Don Diablo, Brooks and many, many more, armed with his ability to read crowds and adjust his sets accordingly like no other DJ.', array['Mainstream','Festivals','Crowd reading']::text[], '/djs/itay-itshaki.webp', '/djs/itay-itshaki-logo.svg', '{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/itay_itshaki/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.app.goo.gl/q6aXnR6xesLNDzdb6"}'::jsonb, 'dj', true, 8, false)
on conflict (company_id, slug) do update set display_name = excluded.display_name, bio_en = excluded.bio_en, photo_url = excluded.photo_url, logo_url = excluded.logo_url, links = excluded.links, kind = excluded.kind;
values (md5('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001:dj:yahav-boaz')::uuid, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Yahav Boaz', 'yahav-boaz', 'Yahav Boaz is an Israeli DJ & performer known for his high-energy sets, strong crowd connection, and a unique blend of mainstream, electronic & Afro house music.

With performances across Israel and internationally including Greece, Spain, Bulgaria, Mexico, and the United States. Yahav continues to build a distinctive sound and stage presence.

His sets combine powerful energy, smooth transitions, and an unforgettable dancefloor experience that keeps the crowd moving all night long.', array['Mainstream','Electronic','Afro house']::text[], '/djs/yahav-boaz.webp', '/djs/yahav-boaz-logo.svg', '{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/yahavboaz_","youtube":"https://youtube.com/@yahavboaz?si=yjzZ858FjDix8dsv","soundcloud":"https://on.soundcloud.com/unUPEr0YinkEdmPYhG","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/user/31apf5qtcvrzlkmv6vwvzexsgxyu?si=rzB1zVZNR0aLOh1mvKHFlg"}'::jsonb, 'dj', true, 9, false)
on conflict (company_id, slug) do update set display_name = excluded.display_name, bio_en = excluded.bio_en, photo_url = excluded.photo_url, logo_url = excluded.logo_url, links = excluded.links, kind = excluded.kind;
values (md5('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001:dj:rotem-ashash')::uuid, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Rotem Ashash', 'rotem-ashash', 'Rotem Ashash is one of the prominent names in Israel’s mainstream DJ scene, with over a decade of experience across clubs and events.

Over the years, he has performed in leading clubs throughout Israel, alongside extensive work in the events industry, including numerous weddings, private events, and corporate productions, where he has built a strong reputation for his precise crowd reading and full control of the dance floor energy.

Rotem specializes in creating a dynamic musical experience that blends current hits, timeless classics, and powerful remixes, all tailored to the crowd and the unique vibe of each event.

At weddings and private events, Rotem brings a combination of experience, musical precision, and personal connection, with the goal of creating a high-energy, packed dance floor from the first track to the last.

His ability to bridge the worlds of clubs and events allows him to turn every event into a true party experience.', array['Mainstream','Hits & remixes','Weddings']::text[], '/djs/rotem-ashash.webp', '/djs/rotem-ashash-logo.svg', '{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/rotem_ashash","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/@DjRotemAshash","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/djrotemashash/tracks","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/user/31qnxjj63t7kpapeysvbu2kjle5i?si=269743f1957f4c5e"}'::jsonb, 'dj', true, 10, false)
