values (md5('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001:dj:ron-nariz')::uuid, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Ron Nariz', 'ron-nariz', '“Maximum Energy, 100 percent love”

His origins are from the land of Samba.
He grew up in a family that loves music and rhythms are his way of life.
Since 9th grade, he has been making his audience enjoying great beats.

He knows how to use all factors for music as tools for magic.
There is no atmosphere he can not create!
Between the audience he creates a bridge.', array['Brazilian rhythms','High energy']::text[], '/djs/ron-nariz.webp', '/djs/ron-nariz-logo.svg', '{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/nariz_music/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/narizmusic","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/2GSup94BLDllB3fi9pcuI5?si=efGKo75JRdy9TEww0t3pZg"}'::jsonb, 'dj', true, 12, false)
on conflict (company_id, slug) do update set display_name = excluded.display_name, bio_en = excluded.bio_en, photo_url = excluded.photo_url, logo_url = excluded.logo_url, links = excluded.links, kind = excluded.kind;
values (md5('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001:dj:fayj')::uuid, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'FayJ', 'fayj', 'FayJ is an international DJ, model, actress, and multidisciplinary creative with over 13 years of experience in the global fashion and entertainment industries. She has walked in runway shows, led fashion productions, and appeared in commercials, TV shows and major campaigns, building a strong on-camera presence and a commanding runway identity.

Expanding her artistic path into music, FayJ developed a distinctive sound and stage persona. As a DJ, she delivers high-impact sets driven by rhythm, sensuality, and movement — blending cool, eclectic musical taste with infectious, dance-floor energy. Her performances are defined by strong stage presence, emotional connection, and an ability to read and elevate the crowd.

FayJ represents a new generation of cross-disciplinary artists — seamlessly merging fashion, performance, and music into one cohesive creative language.', array['Eclectic','Performance','Dance-floor energy']::text[], '/djs/fayj.webp', '/djs/fayj-logo.svg', '{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/fayjakite?igsh=MWtqdmYydGRxaXl3Mw%3D%3D&utm_source=qr","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/@DjFayJ","soundcloud":"https://on.soundcloud.com/muRR0B3YTS2qibC8MU"}'::jsonb, 'dj', true, 13, false)
on conflict (company_id, slug) do update set display_name = excluded.display_name, bio_en = excluded.bio_en, photo_url = excluded.photo_url, logo_url = excluded.logo_url, links = excluded.links, kind = excluded.kind;
values (md5('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001:dj:hard-to-tell')::uuid, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Hard To Tell', 'hard-to-tell', 'Masters of hypnotic grooves, Hard To Tell (HTT) – the dynamic duo of Roy & Roi – are experts at crafting compelling dance floor narratives. Their sound seamlessly blends elements from diverse musical landscapes, from Detroit techno and house to cold wave and new wave, incorporating breakbeat and electroid dynamics to create immersive club experiences that transcend conventional boundaries.

The pair’s compositions masterfully balance between ethereal dreamscapes and powerful, steel-clad rhythms, striking a perfect harmony between muscular functionality and hedonistic sophistication. Their talents caught the attention of Innervisions founders Dixon and Âme, who featured their anthemic track ‘Area 88’ on Secret Weapons 15, followed by the Italo-influenced ‘Last Forever’ on volume 16 of the series. HTT’s productions have become staples in the Innervisions family repertoire and have garnered consistent praise from French legend Laurent Garnier.

Since their individual debuts over a decade ago and the formation of HTT in 2018, Roy and Roi have evolved significantly both artistically and personally. Their releases on respected labels such as Sums Over Histories, Siamese, and Tau (home to their ‘Love Pedal’ EP) showcase their distinctive musical DNA and demonstrate an impact that sets them apart in today’s crowded electronic music landscape.

Their expertise truly shines in their marathon sets, ranging from 5 to 10 hours, where their expansive musical vision adapts seamlessly to both intimate venues and large-scale warehouse environments. This versatility has earned them spots at numerous prestigious clubs and festivals worldwide, with regular appearances in cultural hubs including Berlin, Barcelona, Lisbon, Baku, Limassol, Ibiza, Mykonos, Milan, and Tel-Aviv.', array['Techno','House','New wave','Marathon sets']::text[], '/djs/hard-to-tell.webp', '/djs/hard-to-tell-logo.svg', '{"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/HardToTell.Music","instagram":"https://instagram.com/_hardtotell_?igshid=1m3m6x34nmxyu","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/@hardtotell1992","beatport":"https://www.beatport.com/artist/hard-to-tell/902428","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/hardtotell-music","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/2Fdh88lZzeW3FiSTcyW0LM?si=z_hYFrH9TOOapDKUd4guZw&nd=1&dlsi=89e2454eac564962"}'::jsonb, 'dj', true, 14, false)
on conflict (company_id, slug) do update set display_name = excluded.display_name, bio_en = excluded.bio_en, photo_url = excluded.photo_url, logo_url = excluded.logo_url, links = excluded.links, kind = excluded.kind;
values (md5('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001:dj:eilon-hazan')::uuid, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Eilon Hazan', 'eilon-hazan', 'Eilon Hazan is an Israeli guitarist and live performer specializing in Live on DJ shows, blending live guitar with techno, house, and psy-trance while focusing on energy and connection with the crowd.

He has performed at festivals and clubs across South America including Peru, Brazil, and Colombia  as well as extensively in Israel. Alongside his electronic work, he collaborates as a session guitarist with leading Israeli artists such as Nadav Hanzis, Bar Tzabari, and Noam Kleinstein.

His performances are defined by strong stage presence, professionalism, and a clear goal: keep the dancefloor moving.', array['Live guitar','Live on DJ','Techno / house / psy']::text[], '/djs/eilon-hazan.webp', '/djs/eilon-hazan-logo.svg', '{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/eilonhazan","youtube":"https://youtube.com/@eilonhazan?si=VR-w__Dq3BNSJHzH","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/eilon-hazan"}'::jsonb, 'live', false, 15, false)
